# ROS 2 / colcon outputs (never commit installed build artifacts)
**/build/
**/install/
**/log/
**/.colcon/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/

# Editor/OS caches
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
*~
*.swp

# Secrets and local environment state
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/secrets/
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*

# Simulation logs / ROS recordings / generated temporary data
**/*.db3
**/*.mcap
**/*.bag
**/*.log
**/rosbag2_*/
**/.ros/
**/core
**/core.*

# Large GPU/ML checkpoints should go in releases or LFS
**/*.pt
**/*.pth
**/*.ckpt
**/*.onnx
